  "description": "Seong-Won, a new employee and a gold digger, falls in love with team leader Yang Haru as soon as he joins the company. Seong-Won, who wants to hear the team leader's voice even if it's just an auditory hallucination because he's in love with her, ends up hearing the team leader's voice as an auditory hallucination! But is it really just an auditory hallucination? Or??\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n *Note: Part of Peanutoon's Gosuwi BL Danpyeonseon (고수위 BL 단편선) Collection.*",
